<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλ-ιξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐκος</span>, ἡ, later ὁ (<i><span class="en">
			Phryn.
			283
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Id.
			<u>PS</u>
			p.125
		</span></i>
		<i><span class="en">
			B.
		</span></i>):—mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλικες,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολάδες</span>
			, <i>guts</i> or <i>bowels</i> of oxen, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλικες βοός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				63.4
			</span></i> (anap.); without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				576
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				82
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλικες ἑφθαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					717
				</span></i>
			:sg., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Milet.</u>
				6.21
			</span></i> (V B.C.); Com. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκης
			χόλιξ</span> wool-<i>sausages,</i> cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολάς.</span>)</div>
